# graphify — the knowledge graph of this repo (see graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md)
#
# Only the REPORT is committed. Everything else here is a build artifact that
# `/graphify .` regenerates: graph.json (488K) and graph.html (452K) are derived
# from the source, and cache/ + manifest.json are incremental-build bookkeeping
# that is specific to one checkout.
#
# Note the report is generated with the absolute scan root in its H1, which
# scripts/check_portability.py correctly rejects. Normalise that line after a
# rebuild — the gate catching it is the gate working, not an obstacle.
graphify-out/*
!graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md

# Claude Code agent worktrees live here; they are checkouts of this repo and
# must never be committed into it.
.claude/

# scripts/check_opengrep_baseline.py --findings reads this; the opengrep job writes it
# into the workspace root. It is a CI artifact, never a tracked file.
opengrep.json
